            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Dictate with a single key

- **New:** the dictation shortcut can now be a single key — 🌐 Fn, right ⌥, right ⌘ or right ⌃. Choose it in Settings → Keyboard Shortcut → “Dictate with”. Using the key together with another one (like 🌐 + →) still works as a normal combination.
- **Improved:** dictation and voice notes stop on their own when you stop talking. Pick how many seconds of silence to wait (2–30 s) in Keyboard Shortcut and in Voice Notes.
]]></description>
